# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Not cosmetic. `src/lib/docs.ts` reads the markdown in `docs/` and parses headings out
# of it with regexes; a CRLF checkout broke that silently on Windows while the identical
# code worked on the Linux build server. The reader normalises defensively, and this
# keeps the stored form consistent so the two can never disagree again.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch.
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
